", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JyeZG268WeYQ7kNvwHsbE4C&_nc_oc=Adr3H0M8UavsE8-E2ZXgGl29YtqOo5DnXlADw0Mry09gNSv2pMfzyeoJoCY_7fDupkw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2WDPGut0p6V_aPKx67IKNhz7CCsvF7uhOtWf5M3hU0Zw&oe=69DE4379"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-tNY5v3m8v0Q7kNvwFNc33L&_nc_oc=Adq1k-me06Wm5f2xgh53Kbx5udANy9tQTawXJNZQkF4yEN9TpZmOIcmaKNxIbjUbUqc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0R3xMS39cOkYPM2vt2NufIMdYJRSoF4z_d9rUXzC_hXQ&oe=69DE220B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fhAhyMRT2esQ7kNvwEay_EI&_nc_oc=AdqjTQoVOM6aP-3GjvoVn-xz93WHP47dE6SZTTkK3D8HZPy9Hz53kSdynO7pk5ZZlWc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1zW9p54UOvwq4hmMXdJQHNr0ImoKbOcsXZaHiTJ7PR-g&oe=69DE208E"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel